---
/** Placed in articles only where personalization is naturally the next step. */
---
<aside class="checkup-cta">
  <h2>Want help understanding your own situation?</h2>
  <p>In about five minutes, the BK Checkup asks a few basic questions and gives you a first read on whether bankruptcy might fit your situation, and what it would mean for your debts and the things you own.</p>
  <a href="/checkup" class="btn btn-primary">Start the Checkup</a>
</aside>
<style>
  .checkup-cta {
    background: var(--sage);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    margin: var(--space-5) 0;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .checkup-cta h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .checkup-cta p { color: #fff; margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .checkup-cta .btn-primary { background: #fff; color: var(--sage-deeper); border-color: #fff; }
  .checkup-cta .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--off); }
</style>
